  "answer": "7*ln(2)/2",
  "acceptedAnswers": null,
  "answerUnit": null,
  "answerDisplay": "$\\frac{7\\ln 2}{2}$",
  "solutions": [
   {
    "title": "Partial fractions",
    "body": "$\\frac{3x+4}{(x+1)(x+3)}=\\frac{1/2}{x+1}+\\frac{5/2}{x+3}$. So the integral is $\\frac12\\ln(x+1)+\\frac52\\ln(x+3)\\Big|_0^3=\\frac12\\ln4+\\frac52\\ln6-\\frac52\\ln3=\\ln2+\\frac52\\ln2=\\frac{7\\ln2}2$.\n\n**Answer: $\\frac{7\\ln2}2$**"
   }
  ],
